> I am currently camped out at an altar doing my best to keep from
> getting crowned but mainly trying to acquire Grayswandir.  Earlier I
> had sacrificed something and received Sunsword without praying.  Do
> gods grant artifact weapons from prayer or from sacrificing?  Or both?

Sacrifices will occasionally give you an artifact weapon, first the
role specific one (if any) then any that matches your alignment, or
a random non-aligned one. So if you got Sunsword you're lawful and
might also get Grayswandir, but with every created artifact chances
lessen (and there are 5 lawful and 6 unaligned artifact weapons, if
I counted them correct).

If you pray and get crowned you'll get an alignment specific artifact
(the only possible are: Excalibur, Vorpal Blade, and Stormbringer).

